r($,"i5N","hoa",()=>A.a([A.uC("Manage customer orders from placement through partial or full delivery. Track remaining item quantities per order, record payments against orders, convert deliveries into receipts, and monitor order statuses (Unpaid, Partial, and Paid) with dedicated order reports and thermal/A4 receipts.",0,"Order Management"),A.uC("Save in-progress carts as drafts and resume them anytime without losing selected items, quantities, custom dimensions, prices, discounts, or customer details. Keep your checkout counter moving smoothly when a customer needs time before completing payment.",1,"Draft Sale Management"),A.uC("Enter the exact amount a customer wants to spend during a sale and let Stockall automatically calculate the corresponding item quantity based on the selected unit price. Ideal for weighed, measured, or flexible-quantity sales where customers buy by amount.",2,"Derive Quantity From Price"),A.uC("Create and manage your own payment channels\u2014including Bank Accounts, POS Machines, and Other channels\u2014complete with account numbers, account names, and notes. Select specific channels during single or split payments, and see the exact channel reflected on receipts, invoices, PDF downloads, and thermal printouts.",3,"Custom Payment Channels"),A.uC("Enjoy a cleaner, more organized Customer page with clearer summaries of customer account balances, reward cashback, purchase history, and outstanding invoices. Quickly review customer activity and take action from one unified view.",4,"Customer Page Redesign"),A.uC("Settle multiple unpaid or partially paid invoices for a customer in a single flow instead of paying them off one by one. Apply a payment across outstanding invoices automatically, saving time and keeping customer balances accurate.",5,"Pay Up All Customer Invoices"),A.uC("Configure multiple selling and stocking units for a single item (such as Pieces, Packs, Cartons, or Slabs) with conversion equivalents to your primary unit. Sell, restock, adjust, and transfer items in any configured unit while Stockall keeps total inventory automatically synchronized.",6,"Multiple Units Management"),A.uC("Set up multiple price tiers for each item\u2014such as Retail, Wholesale, or custom unit-based prices\u2014and switch between them effortlessly during sales and invoicing. Ensure the right price is always applied for every customer and selling unit.",7,"Multiple Price Management"),A.uC("Manage 2D sheet and slab items (such as glass, wood, boards, fabric, or tiles) using Width and Height dimensions. Sell, adjust, or transfer either whole slabs or custom cut dimensions, with Stockall automatically calculating area equivalents and tracking remaining stock accurately.",8,"2Dimensional Items Management"),A.uC("Automatically see your profit markup and margin percentages as you set cost and selling prices on products. Make informed pricing decisions faster with real-time profitability feedback right inside your item setup and editing screens.",9,"Products Markup and Margin Calculation"),A.uC("Track a complete audit trail of every product movement\u2014including sales, restocks, manual adjustments, returns, transfers in/out, and production usage. Filter and inspect detailed item history tables and aggregated summaries to see what changed, when, and by whom.",10,"Full Products History Management"),A.uC("Import multiple products into your inventory at once using downloadable CSV or Excel (XLSX) templates. Stockall validates rows upfront and highlights any issues before saving, making large catalog setup and onboarding fast and error-free.",11,"Bulk Products Upload"),A.uC("Select multiple items from your products list and add to or replace their stock quantities in one batch. Supports multiple units as well as whole slabs or custom dimensions for 2D items, with automatic item history logging for every adjustment.",12,"Bulk Stock Adjustment"),A.uC("Transfer multiple selected items at once between branches or departments. Link destination products or auto-create missing ones, specify quantities in any unit\u2014including whole slabs or custom dimensions for 2D items\u2014and review a clear confirmation summary before executing.",13,"Bulk Items Transfer"),A.uC("Explore a completely redesigned Reports hub broken down into focused, easy-to-navigate sections across Sales, Orders, Invoices, Purchases, Customers, Suppliers, Staff, Storage, and Production (split into Material Report, Production Record Report, and Production Items Report).",14,"Full Reports Redesign Breakdown"),A.uC("Export, download, and print your reports in multiple formats\u2014including A4 PDF, thermal roll PDF, CSV/Excel spreadsheets, and direct Bluetooth ESC/POS thermal printing\u2014so you can share, archive, or print summaries wherever you work.",15,"Reports Export, Download and Print")],A.aU("X<a5w>")))
